          "op": "replace",
          "note": "Overrides the ancestor's own 'Vernacular and Gothic Revival' forbiddance -- this variant is exactly that vernacular, and the chamfer with a lamb's-tongue stop is its named porch support (constraint c04, diagnostic_tells)."
