          "note": "Overrides the ancestor's objection ('a 6x6 with a cap. No order, no diminution, no entasis') -- that description is exactly constraint c04's square post, and the absence of order is the point on this node, not a defect."
        },
        {
          "id": "square-pier",
          "status": "canonical",
          "op": "replace",
          "note": "Promoted to canonical alongside chamfered-post -- the two names for the same 4x4-6x6 post (constraint c04)."
